686 - Bless Thou the Gifts
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 686
Topic: Sentences and Responses - 

Verse 1:
[D]Bless [G]Thou [F#dim]the [Em]gifts [Am]our [D7]hands have brought;
[G/B]Bless [C]Thou [D7/A]the [G/B]work [A/C#]our [D]hearts [Am]have [D]planned.
[D]Ours [G]is [Bm]the [Em]faith, [Am]the [D7]will, the thought;
[G/B]The rest, [C]OGod, [D7/A]is in [G/B]Thy hand.
[C]Amen.
